// Vitest Snapshot v1, https://vitest.dev/guide/snapshot.html

exports[`diagramToMarkdown > renders the order saga 1`] = `
"# Order saga

Takes an order to shipping.

## Diagram

\`\`\`mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  state "Awaiting order" as Awaiting_order
  state "Reserving stock" as Reserving_stock
  state "Charging payment" as Charging_payment
  [*] --> Awaiting_order
  Awaiting_order --> Reserving_stock : OrderReceived (from Shop API) / Send ReserveStock
  Reserving_stock --> Charging_payment : StockReserved / Send ChargePayment, Publish PaymentRequested
  Charging_payment --> Completed : PaymentCharged
  Charging_payment --> Cancelled : PaymentFailed
  Charging_payment --> Reserving_stock : compensate: Undo / Send ReserveStock
  Completed --> [*]
  Cancelled --> [*]
  classDef compensation fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#f59e0b,color:#92400e
  class Reserving_stock compensation
\`\`\`

## States

| State | Type | Description | Activities | Compensation | Retry | Timeout |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| Initial | Initial |  |  |  |  |  |
| Awaiting order | State | Waits for the shop. |  |  |  |  |
| Reserving stock | State |  | Send ReserveStock | ReleaseStock: Gives the stock back | 3 attempts | 30s |
| Charging payment | Decision |  | Send ChargePayment<br>Publish PaymentRequested |  |  |  |
| Completed | Final |  |  |  |  |  |
| Cancelled | Final |  |  |  |  |  |

## Transitions

| From | Event | Source | To | Kind |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| Initial |  |  | Awaiting order | Forward |
| Awaiting order | OrderReceived | Shop API | Reserving stock | Forward |
| Reserving stock | StockReserved | external | Charging payment | Forward |
| Charging payment | PaymentCharged | external | Completed | Forward |
| Charging payment | PaymentFailed | external | Cancelled | Forward |
| Charging payment | Undo | external | Reserving stock | Compensation |

## Commands

| Command | Sent in |
| --- | --- |
| ChargePayment | Charging payment |
| ReserveStock | Reserving stock |

## Events

| Event | Origin | Published in | Triggers |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| OrderReceived | External |  | Awaiting order → Reserving stock |
| PaymentCharged | External |  | Charging payment → Completed |
| PaymentFailed | External |  | Charging payment → Cancelled |
| PaymentRequested | Internal | Charging payment |  |
| StockReserved | External |  | Reserving stock → Charging payment |
| Undo | External |  | Charging payment → Reserving stock |
"
`;
